      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE LEXIE (1) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 9 lengths into second (26.23) at this track in a Maiden over 457m. Rates highly and will give a great sight. HIGH COURT JUDGE (8) scored (25.55) last time out at this track in a Maiden and will break from box 8 for the first time. Goes very well at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Sure to be thereabouts. RABARA (4) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (26.37) in a Maiden at this track. Should be about the money. DURAN (7) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
